alPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":8527,"title":"","description":"76","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Fantasy","Comedy","Animation"],"id":8527,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Cool World","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk44/shows/80e21e2e-2a27-4e43-ba31-cd5941f9fcba.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk50/shows/d39a86d2-a9f0-4134-baab-9ac1016768ad.jpg","likes":83,"dislikes":0,"views":6031,"release_date":"710726400000","length":6098,"description":"When cartoonist Jack Deebs was behind bars, he found escape by creating \"Cool World\", a cartoon series featuring a voluptuous femme fatale named Holli Would. But the cartoonist becomes a prisoner of his own fantasies when Holli transports Jack into Cool World with a scheme to seduce him and bring herself to life. A hard-boiled detective--the only other human in Cool World--cautions Jack with the law: Noids (humans) don't have sex with doodles (cartoons). However, the flesh proves weaker than ink as Holli takes human form in Las Vegas, staring in a trans-universal chase that threatens the destruction of both worlds. With a splashy combination of animation and live-action sequences, \"Cool World\" delivers the hottest action around.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":4.8}],"value":4.8,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":8527,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}